-Investing\">Step Into a 12% Yearly Earning Potential &#8211; Blount County &#8211; Alabama Tax Lien Investing</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Don&#8217;t miss out on this unique opportunity to grow your investments up to 12% yearly!</strong> Blount County, Alabama&#8217;s Tax Lien Sale opens doors to potentially high returns or even property ownership. All through a simple online auction process at <a href=\"http://govease.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">GovEase</mark></a></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Here&#8217;s how it works: When you buy a tax lien, you’re essentially purchasing the right to collect overdue property taxes, not the property itself. This method can lead to owning the property if the taxes remain unpaid. Aim to bid the lowest interest rate, starting from 12% and decreasing. If you win, you can either reclaim your investment with significant interest or take ownership of the property after the three-year redemption period.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The online platform simplifies everything. Register, dive into property research, and place your bids from the comfort of your home.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Blount-County-Tax-Lien-Sale-Details\">Blount County Tax Lien Sale Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"How-to-Get-Started\">How to Get Started</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Register on GovEase</strong>: Create a profile on the GovEase Auction Portal. Registration opens in February.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Research Properties</strong>: Investigate the properties listed for auction to understand any liens or other debts attached to them.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Place Your Bids</strong>: The online auction will be held in March, starting at 9:00 a.m. CST.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Payment</strong>: Ensure you have the correct payment method rea